ARM64_LPA2	y	CPU extension, default y: detected per CPU at run time; the Cortex-A57 and A53 of the Exynos 5433 are ARMv8.0 and do not implement it: 52-bit physical addresses (ARMv8.2-LPA). Follows ARM64_PA_BITS_52, so it is not selected once the virtual address space is 39 bits (our change)
ARM64_LSE_ATOMICS	y	no prompt: a capability flag that the arm64 architecture, or its toolchain check, selects. Not a choice
ARM64_MTE	y	CPU extension, default y: detected per CPU at run time; the Cortex-A57 and A53 of the Exynos 5433 are ARMv8.0 and do not implement it
