ARM64_PA_BITS_52	y	arm64 default that our change removes as a consequence of ARM64_VA_BITS_39: with 4 KiB pages the 52-bit choice exists only when the virtual address space is 52 bits
ARM64_PLATFORM_DEVICES	y	default y: a menu (drivers of arm64 platforms)
