ARM_GIC_V3	y	no prompt: a capability flag that the arm64 architecture, or its toolchain check, selects. Not a choice: GICv3 / GICv3-ITS / GICv2m interrupt controller drivers, built by default. They probe only on a matching device tree node; the Exynos 5433 has a GIC-400 (v2)
